    "detailed_description": "Reactivated is a first-person horror game in dark sci-fi settings.<br />\r\nPlayers are to explore, survive and make decisions that will affect the outcome at the end, which are 2 at the moment.<br />\r\nThere are no intended jump-scares, only the chill on your back when you get to the point where you'll realize: \u201cThere are no jump-scares.\u201d<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cFor we do not have a high priest who is unable to empathize with our weaknesses, but we have one who has been tempted in every way, just as we are\u2014yet he did not sin.\u201d<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHebrews 4:15",
